<p>A vlog is a day, so the picture is the day and nothing stands in front of it: the photograph fills the frame, the scrim darkens the foot for the words, REC blinks in the corner with a timecode, and the viewfinder corners say this was filmed rather than posed. The day number is the hand’s job here — “day 12”, big, top right — and the title stays short at the foot.</p>
